<import src="../../templates/state.wxml"/><view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">SHARE THE GOOD</view><view class="title">我的友好发现</view><view class="row between"><text class="subtitle">你的分享，让更多毛孩子被欢迎。</text><text class="link" bindtap="add">＋ 投稿</text></view><template is="state" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view style="margin-top:28rpx"><view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id" class="card" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><view class="row between"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><text class="tag {{item.status===2?'red':item.status===1?'green':''}}">{{item.statusText}}</text></view><view class="muted">{{item.address}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.rejection}}" class="hint">驳回原因：{{item.rejection}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.timeText}} · 查看详情 ›</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!list.length && !loading}}" class="empty"><image src="/images/map-active.png"/>你还没有投稿，分享第一个好去处吧。<button class="secondary" bindtap="add">提交友好点位</button></view></view>
